["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Lintel Conquest of UNIX Lintel GPL Active Directory IA-64 / Itanium distro\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-asianometry-打垮-unix-的不是-windows-而是-intel-扶持的-linux/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c89d1667eef4960d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>打垮 UNIX 的不是 Windows,而是 Intel 扶持的 Linux</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">UNIX 陣營靠專有硬件和操作系統把客戶鎖死多年，Intel 先用 Windows NT 撬開缺口，但真正要命的是免費、能看源碼、不怕被鎖死的 Linux。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Linux</span><span class=\"tag\">UNIX</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"An 86-minute guide to finding PMF | Rob Snyder (Author, The Power of Pull) PULL framework Hail Mary question Goblin mode Design partner\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-lennys-好产品不是说服出来的-是发现客户已经卡住的那件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de7a163b06c13a51-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>好產品不是說服出來的，是發現客戶已經卡住的那件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人常以為要靠說服讓客戶買單，Rob的核心論斷是：拉力早就存在於客戶的待辦清單裡，你的工作只是去發現那個會把產品從你手裡搶走的人，而不是創造渴望。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品市場契合</span><span class=\"tag\">早期銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Podcast: Kimi K3.1 Pro, the new cyber reality, and Muse musings astroturfing abliterated model B300 / NVL72 PHP2Shell\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-interconnects-php漏洞公开后无人作恶-网络安全瓶颈不是ai而是没人打补丁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0c99c5f34972836e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">46:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>PHP漏洞公開後無人作惡：網絡安全瓶頸不是AI而是沒人打補丁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi主動壓低自身攻擊能力以示負責；PHP高危漏洞曝光後預期的大規模黑客利用並未出現——瓶頸是企業幾年不打補丁，而非AI能力強弱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1369: Florida Model Makes Measles Great Again VHIT (vaccine-induced herd immunity threshold) vaccination reproduction number (R_v) HLA class I CTL epitope founder effect escape mutation / epitope variant\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-twiv-佛州还没取消疫苗强制令-麻疹就已经跌破群体免疫线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:57:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>佛州還沒取消疫苗強制令，麻疹就已經跌破群體免疫線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">佛州兒童疫苗接種率只有91.6%,已經低於阻斷麻疹所需閾值；取消強制令後接種率或跌到82%,麻疹將在十年內變成持續50年的地方病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Clean Neurons, Black October, the GPU Credit Crunch, and Buying the Supply Chain cognitive core Harberger tax polysemanticity bitter lesson adversarial diffusion take-or-pay contract\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-cogrev-创业ai实验室真正缺的不是gpu-而是信用评级/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4b361faf0df2675a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>創業AI實驗室真正缺的不是GPU，而是信用評級</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">放貸人收回一臺超算後根本不知道它值多少錢，於是新實驗室只能靠預付全款換長約——這才是算力擴張的真正瓶頸，不是芯片或電力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力信用</span><span class=\"tag\">供應鏈瓶頸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Malcolm Gaskill on Why Our Ancestors Weren&#x27;t as Superstitious as We Think pareidolia confessional state\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-goodfight-两百年猎巫审判仅十一万起-启蒙运动后数字才被夸大到百万/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>兩百年獵巫審判僅十一萬起，啟蒙運動後數字才被誇大到百萬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真實的獵巫審判記錄顯示，十六至十七世紀歐洲審判約十一萬起，陪審團常以證據不足拒絕定罪——這幅畫面遠比「集體瘋狂」複雜，也遠比後世想像的溫和。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">獵巫審判</span><span class=\"tag\">啟蒙運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How a Chicago Restaurant Has Stayed Open For Nearly Three Decades farm-to-table ghost kitchen shared kitchen prix fixe GLP-1\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-oddlots-独立高端餐厅行业-整体回报率是负的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>獨立高端餐廳行業，整體回報率是負的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">開了近30年高端餐廳的老闆說，獨立餐飲沒有護城河、誰都能抄配方，守法經營還要比同行多付5%到10%成本，行業整體回報因此是負的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">餐飲</span><span class=\"tag\">小生意經濟學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Cyber Panic, Ken Griffin&#x27;s Bubble Warning, The Fall of France? PHP to shell virtual patch bond vigilantes Obliteration AI chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-allin-ai支出的90-来自1-的公司-八成是亏损的创业公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9af963e06c2ea01b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>AI支出的90%來自1%的公司，八成是虧損的創業公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">錢從VC流向創業公司，創業公司把錢花在AI上做出營收，再回頭找VC加輪融資——這是閉環，不是真實擴散。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Embracing the Bond Market: Masters in Business with Robin Wigglesworth Consols Sukuk Securitization Bearer bond CBO\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-mastersinbiz-ai-泡沫本身不可怕-可怕的是它越来越靠发债撑着/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>AI 泡沫本身不可怕，可怕的是它越來越靠發債撐著</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歷史數據顯示，由股權推動的泡沫破裂後經濟影響有限，由信貸推動的泡沫破裂才真正傷筋動骨，而今年AI超大廠商發債規模已從2000億美元跳到5000億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">債券市場</span><span class=\"tag\">美國國債</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI越強大，人為什麼越累｜欽文對話馬兆遠 Testing Knowledge\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-wangqinwen-效率翻倍后是早下班还是裁员加班-决定了技术会不会让人更累/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fc78e021049c424-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"王\"><span class=\"dur\">25:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">王欽文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>效率翻倍後是早下班還是裁員加班，決定了技術會不會讓人更累</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅素百年前問過同一個問題：工廠效率提高一倍後，是分享給工人更多休息，還是裁掉一半人、逼剩下的人加班自保，AI不過是這道選擇題的最新版本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生育率</span><span class=\"tag\">教育改革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Democratizing Security for the Agentic Web with Cloudflare CTO Dane Knecht CVE WebPKI Zero Trust AEO X402 CPM/CTM\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-nopriors-cdn巨头cto预言-未来18个月一半工程时间要用来补漏洞/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/44db1fd0a7b5258a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">41:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>CDN巨頭CTO預言：未來18個月一半工程時間要用來補漏洞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">漏洞披露速度從一年一次變成每週多次，連TLS信任根密鑰都曾被人用種子數字4破解——CTO說未來18個月，一半工程資源要砸向安全。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Netflix Angst, The End of the Internet, Q&amp;A on Meta’s VR Glasses, Anthropic Alignment, You Can See Everything elliptical curve cryptography zero trust generative UI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-sharptech-广告模式能无限涨价不流失用户-订阅模式做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>廣告模式能無限漲價不流失用戶，訂閱模式做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">廣告定價能隨算法變準持續上漲、不影響用戶留存；訂閱漲價一旦引發流失就晚了——這正是奈飛參與度下滑、廣告營收目標又沒達標時真正該慌的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">奈飛</span><span class=\"tag\">廣告變現</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Forgotten Godmother of Economic Literature Edgeworth box marginalists labor theory of value DSGE racked rent\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-oddlots-比简-奥斯汀还畅销的她-因在小说里说教太重被经济学史遗忘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">43:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>比簡·奧斯汀還暢銷的她，因在小說裡說教太重被經濟學史遺忘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她的小說比《國富論》原著好讀得多，卻因為教育意味太濃，在簡·奧斯汀式自然主義敘事興起後被讀者和經濟學史一起拋棄。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">經濟思想史</span><span class=\"tag\">女性經濟學家</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"反地產邏輯，為什麼成就了阿那亞｜欽文對話馬寅\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-wangqinwen-阿那亚的成功靠的是没有退路-不是战略远见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f06d53df338a0f19-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"王\"><span class=\"dur\">28:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">王欽文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>阿那亞的成功靠的是沒有退路，不是戰略遠見</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">馬寅說如果2012年還能像別的開發商一樣快進快出賺快錢，他絕不會死磕阿那亞——是十億貸款和只剩這一個項目的絕境，逼出了這套反地產邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">長期主義</span><span class=\"tag\">社區運營</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"重新定義個人電腦，老黃到底憑什麼？RTX Spark深度解析 PRISM MXC Windows on ARM PAIR Prefill/Decode MOE\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-laoshi-rtx-spark芯片没变-英伟达要的不是性能而是pc定义权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">老</div><span class=\"dur\">24:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">老石談芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>RTX Spark芯片沒變，英偉達要的不是性能而是PC定義權</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這顆芯片幾乎就是去年發布的DGX Spark換了操作系統，老黃真正想要的不是跑分贏家，而是把CPU、GPU、內存、系統捆成一套只認英偉達規則的PC新架構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">CUDA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Compute Comes in Rectangles — Erik Bernhardsson, Modal CEO BYOC Neoclouds spot capacity FDE MFU\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-latentspace-gpu-稀缺的真正病根-算力只能整块按三年期打包购买/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7cf8550aeeab084a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>GPU 稀缺的真正病根：算力只能整塊按三年期打包購買</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說，GPU 短缺最大的問題不是搶不到卡，而是幾乎所有產能都打包成三到六個月後交付的三年期合約出售，這和大多數客戶真實的忽高忽低的需求完全對不上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力採購</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU稀缺</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Here’s Why Experts Keep Being Wrong About the Future radical uncertainty hindsight bias\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-goodfight-预测失败不是数据问题-是未来本身不可知/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">9:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>預測失敗不是數據問題，是未來本身不可知</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">手握數據、模型和算力的專家照樣在2008年集體失算，因為未來不是等信息補全的拼圖，而是一張還沒畫出來的空白畫布。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">不確定性</span><span class=\"tag\">預測失誤</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What will computer chips look like in 2045? EUV High-NA EUV Gate-all-around (GAA) CFET Backside power Hybrid bonding\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-dwarkesh-就算无限砸钱-先进芯片产能也只能翻倍-不是十倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21bf8bafac799fac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>就算無限砸錢，先進芯片產能也只能翻倍，不是十倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英特爾CTO說，哪怕拿出無限資本開支，現有全球芯片製造設備存量也只能讓先進製程晶圓產能翻一倍——而AI算力需求過去十年每年增長三倍，缺口只會越拉越大。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體制造</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片產能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Apex Predator: CrowdStrike CEO George Kurtz on Adversaries Armed With AI Agents pyramid of pain breakout time ablated models digital twin distillation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-nopriors-ai抹平攻击门槛-脚本小子也能用上国家级黑客的本事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad8f4d231b5e5ea8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">45:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>AI抹平攻擊門檻：腳本小子也能用上國家級黑客的本事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">開源大模型裝在家用電腦上就能造勒索軟件，入侵後平均29分鐘、最快27秒就能在系統裡橫向移動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bhaskar Sunkara Thinks the Market Has a Place Under Socialism market socialism soft budget constraint benchmark wage DSA Rawlsian liberalism labor-managed firm\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-oddlots-激进版社会主义-土地全部公有-但房租仍由市场决定/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">53:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>激進版社會主義：土地全部公有，但房租仍由市場決定</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他主張，社會主義不必靠配給：把土地和住房全部收歸公有後，仍可以保留按市場定價的租金和搬遷自由，用價格而不是配給來分配空間。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">市場社會主義</span><span class=\"tag\">工人所有制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The charity that is also a time machine donor-advised fund (DAF) Schedule B chimera\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-22-complexsys-美国的捐赠基金其实是个时间机器-减税现在拿-捐钱以后再说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b98a243f0a884fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">27:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>美國的捐贈基金其實是個時間機器：減稅現在拿，捐錢以後再說</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這是一套合法的「慈善時間機器」：把錢存進去立刻減稅，捐給誰、何時捐可以往後拖很多年——Anthropic員工未來的鉅額捐款很可能就走這條路。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">慈善</span><span class=\"tag\">稅務</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Cure to Founder Burnout Isn&#x27;t Rest | 6 Solo Founders swallow the frog chief of staff\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-solofounders-创始人倦怠的解药不是休息-而是重新找到动力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/18d01623f9e39d48-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>創始人倦怠的解藥不是休息，而是重新找到動力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在Lindy熬了兩年多後，Flo以為自己需要半年假期才能恢復，但真正讓他走出倦怠的，是重新找到動力的那一刻，精力幾乎立刻就回來了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創始人倦怠</span><span class=\"tag\">獨自創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI lab staff: Has your project been overtaken by events? 8 strategic updates | Rob Wiblin RSI (recursive self-improvement) CoT monitoring Overton window eval awareness mech interp model organism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-eightythousand-ai员工能拖慢失控进程-但这份议价权正在快速清零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d87b66f6770249f5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">14:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>AI員工能拖慢失控進程，但這份議價權正在快速清零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">技術員工能靠罷工式不配合為對齊研究拖出時間，但這種槓桿只在公司還離不開他們時成立——一旦模型自動化了他們的工作，這份權力就會歸零，所以能用就得現在用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">遞歸自我改進</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Unearthed! in October 2026, Part 2 borrow pit maquette clinker-built\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-stuffmissed-中国壁画两千年不褪色-秘密是血液而非颜料/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>中國壁畫兩千年不褪色，秘密是血液而非顏料</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">左江花山岩畫兩千年保持鮮紅，科學分析發現顏料用石灰漿混血液作粘合劑，部分血液來自產後女性，可能帶有母系社會的儀式意味。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">沉船</span>\n</div></div></a>"]